(6361025, 942174, 105555, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much and the sun on the wings, if the sky had been just a bit less cloudy, it would have been a great picture...</td>', 'I like the composition very much and the sun on the wings, if the sky had been just a bit less cloudy, it would have been a great picture...', '2011-03-23 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361026, 941933, 105555, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the colors, and the moon.</td>', 'I like the softness of the colors, and the moon.', '2011-03-23 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361029, 942018, 105555, '<td valign="top">Wow! A very nice picture.</td>', 'Wow! A very nice picture.', '2011-03-23 09:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361034, 942263, 51638, '<td valign="top">Not sure how the grain will be received by most, but it works for me. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Not sure how the grain will be received by most, but it works for me. Interesting shot.', '2011-03-23 09:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361036, 941735, 51638, '<td valign="top">The saturation of the sky has been pushed just a little too far. At least that''s the way it appears on my monitor.</td>', 'The saturation of the sky has been pushed just a little too far. At least that''s the way it appears on my monitor.', '2011-03-23 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361043, 942013, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the cut off wing tip is bugging me, as is the distraction of the brightly colour flowers. I reckon you could have cropped the flowers. My son reckons you should have converted to B&amp;W so that the flowers wouldn''t be so much of a distraction. I think he''s right. Good job all the same.</td>', 'Great capture, but the cut off wing tip is bugging me, as is the distraction of the brightly colour flowers. I reckon you could have cropped the flowers. My son reckons you should have converted to B&W so that the flowers wouldn''t be so much of a distraction. I think he''s right. Good job all the same.', '2011-03-23 09:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361057, 941565, 51638, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. The only question is what colour ribbon this will end up with.</td>', 'Outstanding. The only question is what colour ribbon this will end up with.', '2011-03-23 09:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361059, 941395, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but judging by the tethers on the legs I''m guessing a bird show shot. That reduces the ''degree of difficulty'' just a little IMO. Awesome focus on the head tho.</td>', 'Great shot, but judging by the tethers on the legs I''m guessing a bird show shot. That reduces the ''degree of difficulty'' just a little IMO. Awesome focus on the head tho.', '2011-03-23 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6361062, 941129, 51638, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I''m a fan of the processing here. Sorry.</td>', 'Can''t say I''m a fan of the processing here. Sorry.', '2011-03-23 09:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
