(6361126, 941437, 126838, '<td valign="top">This is so like mine ....nice catch...This is the only way to shoot birds! :) Good luck</td>', 'This is so like mine ....nice catch...This is the only way to shoot birds! :) Good luck', '2011-03-23 10:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
