(6362277, 941070, 124256, '<td valign="top">It looks like a painting.  There is a strong suggestion of motion, maybe just because of the focus and subject (versus motion blur).  Starting above the bird, wrapping around to the left, then down across to the right in a c shape (or nautilus), there is almost a frame of extra blur that comes across to me as focus based vignetting.  I am annoyed at how much I like this one.  Awesome.</td>', 'It looks like a painting.  There is a strong suggestion of motion, maybe just because of the focus and subject (versus motion blur).  Starting above the bird, wrapping around to the left, then down across to the right in a c shape (or nautilus), there is almost a frame of extra blur that comes across to me as focus based vignetting.  I am annoyed at how much I like this one.  Awesome.', '2011-03-24 09:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362278, 942176, 124256, '<td valign="top">Stunning detail, lighting, pose, timing, awesome.  I love it.</td>', 'Stunning detail, lighting, pose, timing, awesome.  I love it.', '2011-03-24 09:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362279, 941395, 124256, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Nat Geo cover to me.  The pose, the action, the bokeh, the beautiful detail on the subject.  I love it.</td>', 'Looks like a Nat Geo cover to me.  The pose, the action, the bokeh, the beautiful detail on the subject.  I love it.', '2011-03-24 09:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362281, 941119, 124256, '<td valign="top">I don''t recall ever seeing a photo so clearly showing a duck lowering and fanning out its tail and adding its feet to prep for landing on water, though I recognize it and have seen it many times.  Head position also lends some nice personality.  I feel I can relate to this duck.</td>', 'I don''t recall ever seeing a photo so clearly showing a duck lowering and fanning out its tail and adding its feet to prep for landing on water, though I recognize it and have seen it many times.  Head position also lends some nice personality.  I feel I can relate to this duck.', '2011-03-24 09:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362283, 941565, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, beautiful wing position.  I love that the subject is looking to its side towards the photographer.  "What''s that? You''re taking my picture?  Of course you are!  I''m gorgeous!"</td>', 'Ah, beautiful wing position.  I love that the subject is looking to its side towards the photographer.  "What''s that? You''re taking my picture?  Of course you are!  I''m gorgeous!"', '2011-03-24 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362286, 941814, 124256, '<td valign="top">I loved this at first.  The alignment is fantastic.  Then, after reading the title I looked more carefully and not I can''t fight the sensation that I am looking straight up at a dive bomber -- and I swear I can feel that bird falling out of the sky right at me.  Love it.</td>', 'I loved this at first.  The alignment is fantastic.  Then, after reading the title I looked more carefully and not I can''t fight the sensation that I am looking straight up at a dive bomber -- and I swear I can feel that bird falling out of the sky right at me.  Love it.', '2011-03-24 09:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362287, 942068, 124256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action shot!  I love the inter-species interaction.  I think I would have used a different title, though.  Maybe Goose goosed by goose.</td>', 'Wonderful action shot!  I love the inter-species interaction.  I think I would have used a different title, though.  Maybe Goose goosed by goose.', '2011-03-24 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362288, 942277, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the monochrome, and the shade of blue is so perfect: it looks like skies I remember from my childhood.  Also a rare case where I really like the border.  The thin black line echoes the thickness of the twigs while the extended blue just feels like more sky.</td>', 'I love the monochrome, and the shade of blue is so perfect: it looks like skies I remember from my childhood.  Also a rare case where I really like the border.  The thin black line echoes the thickness of the twigs while the extended blue just feels like more sky.', '2011-03-24 09:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362289, 942013, 124256, '<td valign="top">The title really helps elevate this one.  Fantastic story in a great shot!</td>', 'The title really helps elevate this one.  Fantastic story in a great shot!', '2011-03-24 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6362291, 942267, 124256, '<td valign="top">I feel like the bird just caught me doing something I wasn''t supposed to do, and is now preparing to head my way to teach me a lesson.  I love it.</td>', 'I feel like the bird just caught me doing something I wasn''t supposed to do, and is now preparing to head my way to teach me a lesson.  I love it.', '2011-03-24 09:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
