(6362937, 941927, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of this moment.</td>', 'Very nice capture of this moment.', '2011-03-24 21:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363042, 941923, 124256, '<td valign="top">This seems like a dramatic action scene in a movie.  The war-torn hero swoops in for another attack.</td>', 'This seems like a dramatic action scene in a movie.  The war-torn hero swoops in for another attack.', '2011-03-24 22:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363045, 941927, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love how the two birds are at opposite extremes flapping their wings.  The action, water spray, and and interaction between the two subjects is just awesome.  The one foot in the water is perfect.</td>', 'I love how the two birds are at opposite extremes flapping their wings.  The action, water spray, and and interaction between the two subjects is just awesome.  The one foot in the water is perfect.', '2011-03-24 22:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363046, 942250, 124256, '<td valign="top">Such a clean, clear, polished look.  Very nice.</td>', 'Such a clean, clear, polished look.  Very nice.', '2011-03-24 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363047, 942298, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the twigs in varying degrees of focus from which the bird, sharply in focus, emerges, heading into the murky abyss.</td>', 'I love the twigs in varying degrees of focus from which the bird, sharply in focus, emerges, heading into the murky abyss.', '2011-03-24 22:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363049, 941869, 124256, '<td valign="top">At first the cropping bothered me.  Then, appreciating the beautiful shadow and just enough face to appreciate the carry out, I decided I love it.  Nice shot.  Placement of the hazy border between sand is sea is great too.</td>', 'At first the cropping bothered me.  Then, appreciating the beautiful shadow and just enough face to appreciate the carry out, I decided I love it.  Nice shot.  Placement of the hazy border between sand is sea is great too.', '2011-03-24 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363052, 941980, 124256, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background have a Monet-like impressionistic look that I love.  Meanwhile, it looks like the bird is going to eat whatever is next to me.  Great shot.</td>', 'The trees in the background have a Monet-like impressionistic look that I love.  Meanwhile, it looks like the bird is going to eat whatever is next to me.  Great shot.', '2011-03-24 22:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363053, 941398, 124256, '<td valign="top">Looks like an angel.  The wing pose is spectacular.  I absolutely love the fully fanned out tail.  Awesome.</td>', 'Looks like an angel.  The wing pose is spectacular.  I absolutely love the fully fanned out tail.  Awesome.', '2011-03-24 22:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363055, 942038, 124256, '<td valign="top">To me the shot seems washed out in a way that suggests the desert instead of the ocean.  I wish the colors where more vivid.  Still, I love the gradient sky in the background, the bird''s pose, and the lighting.  Nice shot.</td>', 'To me the shot seems washed out in a way that suggests the desert instead of the ocean.  I wish the colors where more vivid.  Still, I love the gradient sky in the background, the bird''s pose, and the lighting.  Nice shot.', '2011-03-24 22:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363057, 942018, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love your subject.  I wish the wingtips were in focus.  Still, great shot.</td>', 'I love your subject.  I wish the wingtips were in focus.  Still, great shot.', '2011-03-24 22:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363059, 941518, 124256, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the neck stripe distractingly blends with the right wing.  Also, there are a handful of distracting reflections on the water (such as right near the beak).  Aside from those things, spectacular shot.  Catching the wingtip touching the water was just fantastic.</td>', 'Unfortunately the neck stripe distractingly blends with the right wing.  Also, there are a handful of distracting reflections on the water (such as right near the beak).  Aside from those things, spectacular shot.  Catching the wingtip touching the water was just fantastic.', '2011-03-24 22:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363061, 941880, 124256, '<td valign="top">The angle of the head and beak and splayed fingertips really communicate some amazing personality to me.  I love how you framed the shot too.  Awesome.</td>', 'The angle of the head and beak and splayed fingertips really communicate some amazing personality to me.  I love how you framed the shot too.  Awesome.', '2011-03-24 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363064, 942019, 124256, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I wish I couldn''t see the bird''s head at all, or if it''s better to see the little bit I can.  Aside from that, I love the sharp color contrast in the wings and tail and the beautifully out of focus water beyond.  For this shot I really like the black bars emphasizing the horizontal.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I wish I couldn''t see the bird''s head at all, or if it''s better to see the little bit I can.  Aside from that, I love the sharp color contrast in the wings and tail and the beautifully out of focus water beyond.  For this shot I really like the black bars emphasizing the horizontal.', '2011-03-24 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363067, 942128, 124256, '<td valign="top">I have been waffling on whether I think the extreme contrast was too much or not.  Regardless, the shot works for me.  I just wonder if I would have liked it more if the shot was more zoomed in for fewer birds but clearer silhouettes.</td>', 'I have been waffling on whether I think the extreme contrast was too much or not.  Regardless, the shot works for me.  I just wonder if I would have liked it more if the shot was more zoomed in for fewer birds but clearer silhouettes.', '2011-03-24 22:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363068, 942164, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the straight line blur of the background; I love the motion blur of the birds'' wings.  The shot would not be nearly as effective without the sunlight glinting off their beaks.  Awesome.</td>', 'I love the straight line blur of the background; I love the motion blur of the birds'' wings.  The shot would not be nearly as effective without the sunlight glinting off their beaks.  Awesome.', '2011-03-24 22:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363070, 941022, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the detailed look at the plumage.  I wish the background was hazier, lighter, or just a different color.  I prefer the bluish hues towards the top versus brownish ones towards the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the detailed look at the plumage.  I wish the background was hazier, lighter, or just a different color.  I prefer the bluish hues towards the top versus brownish ones towards the bottom.', '2011-03-24 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363071, 942263, 124256, '<td valign="top">It almost doesn''t seem real.  I would have titled it Y.  I love the gritty look.</td>', 'It almost doesn''t seem real.  I would have titled it Y.  I love the gritty look.', '2011-03-24 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363072, 942111, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish it was in better focus.  I wish there was more open sky in the shot to the right and below which to me would suggest more motion through the sky.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish it was in better focus.  I wish there was more open sky in the shot to the right and below which to me would suggest more motion through the sky.', '2011-03-24 22:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363074, 941435, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the commotion.  I wish the plaque on the dock tied to the challenge or otherwise added another layer to the story.  As it is I think I''d prefer that the dock wasn''t in the shot at all.  Still, very nice shot.</td>', 'I love the commotion.  I wish the plaque on the dock tied to the challenge or otherwise added another layer to the story.  As it is I think I''d prefer that the dock wasn''t in the shot at all.  Still, very nice shot.', '2011-03-24 22:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363078, 941220, 124256, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I love seeing the light through the wingtip feathers and the toes.  Great shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I love seeing the light through the wingtip feathers and the toes.  Great shot.', '2011-03-24 22:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363079, 942171, 124256, '<td valign="top">I wish the head was in better focus, but I think the pose if perfect in this shot and I love the water spray.  Very nice.</td>', 'I wish the head was in better focus, but I think the pose if perfect in this shot and I love the water spray.  Very nice.', '2011-03-24 22:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363081, 941894, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the cropping on this shot.  I wish there was more light on the bird.  If there was, though, I''m not certain I''d like the shot better.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love the cropping on this shot.  I wish there was more light on the bird.  If there was, though, I''m not certain I''d like the shot better.  Very nice.', '2011-03-24 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
