(6363130, 941518, 121082, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. In my top 3.</td>', 'Nice capture. In my top 3.', '2011-03-24 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363131, 941398, 121082, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Top 3 for sure.</td>', 'Very nice. Top 3 for sure.', '2011-03-24 23:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363144, 942310, 124256, '<td valign="top">The only bird in flight I see here is a blur that blends in with the background.  The real focus of this shot is the yellow wire which doesn''t work for me.  The only other birds are either mostly hidden or facing away.  The bird feeders just seem out of place but also the primary focus.  Sorry, I don''t care for the shot.</td>', 'The only bird in flight I see here is a blur that blends in with the background.  The real focus of this shot is the yellow wire which doesn''t work for me.  The only other birds are either mostly hidden or facing away.  The bird feeders just seem out of place but also the primary focus.  Sorry, I don''t care for the shot.', '2011-03-25 00:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363148, 941968, 124256, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the bird is not in flight, and the grass in the background appears to be in focus while the bird is not.  Sorry, I don''t care of the shot.</td>', 'Yeah, the bird is not in flight, and the grass in the background appears to be in focus while the bird is not.  Sorry, I don''t care of the shot.', '2011-03-25 00:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363151, 942303, 124256, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t work for me.  I don''t know if it''s the post processing or the focus.  Is the background in focus but the birds are out of focus?  I do like the super dark subjects on a vivid background, just wish the shot came together somehow.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t work for me.  I don''t know if it''s the post processing or the focus.  Is the background in focus but the birds are out of focus?  I do like the super dark subjects on a vivid background, just wish the shot came together somehow.', '2011-03-25 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363155, 941524, 124256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  I wish it was flying.  The pedestal is jarringly out of place and the background is very distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  I wish it was flying.  The pedestal is jarringly out of place and the background is very distracting.', '2011-03-25 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363159, 942172, 124256, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t work for me.  Nothing is in focus, and this doesn''t seem deliberate or add anything.  Maybe cropping out the amputated twigs on the bottom would help.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t work for me.  Nothing is in focus, and this doesn''t seem deliberate or add anything.  Maybe cropping out the amputated twigs on the bottom would help.', '2011-03-25 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363163, 941962, 124256, '<td valign="top">You have birds in flight.  I wish they were more the focus.  I don''t like that the splashes of color are just the jackets worn by a couple of folks on the boat.  Maybe going bw would have helped.  The color of the water is jarring against the wonderfully beautiful trees and hills (and clouds) in the background.</td>', 'You have birds in flight.  I wish they were more the focus.  I don''t like that the splashes of color are just the jackets worn by a couple of folks on the boat.  Maybe going bw would have helped.  The color of the water is jarring against the wonderfully beautiful trees and hills (and clouds) in the background.', '2011-03-25 00:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363171, 942186, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot.  The empty bench, interfering trees (which could have helped bring balance elsewhere in the framing), and just the diminutive size of the coupes really prevent the shot from working for me.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot.  The empty bench, interfering trees (which could have helped bring balance elsewhere in the framing), and just the diminutive size of the coupes really prevent the shot from working for me.', '2011-03-25 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363174, 941739, 124256, '<td valign="top">I feel like I should like this one much more than I do.  The backdrop with conspicuous shadows doesn''t make sense to me, I wish it wasn''t there.  And I feel like post processing makes the birds look painted and unreal in a way that doesn''t work.  Too much smoothing?  Also I''m not sure what is in focus if anything.  The mutual eye contact does seem like something special.</td>', 'I feel like I should like this one much more than I do.  The backdrop with conspicuous shadows doesn''t make sense to me, I wish it wasn''t there.  And I feel like post processing makes the birds look painted and unreal in a way that doesn''t work.  Too much smoothing?  Also I''m not sure what is in focus if anything.  The mutual eye contact does seem like something special.', '2011-03-25 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363178, 942316, 124256, '<td valign="top">Although the colors of the smouldering sunset are nice, I think this should would benefit from much more aggressive cropping.</td>', 'Although the colors of the smouldering sunset are nice, I think this should would benefit from much more aggressive cropping.', '2011-03-25 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363181, 941026, 124256, '<td valign="top">Looks like it is almost in focus which makes me almost like it.</td>', 'Looks like it is almost in focus which makes me almost like it.', '2011-03-25 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363184, 941842, 124256, '<td valign="top">There is a very distracting bit of color, yellow, at the top that seems inadvertent.  Also, some details in the background are distracting as well, especially the one right above the left wing.  I do like the pose on the bird, and the out of focusness seems to work.  I think I would enjoy the graininess more if this was bw.</td>', 'There is a very distracting bit of color, yellow, at the top that seems inadvertent.  Also, some details in the background are distracting as well, especially the one right above the left wing.  I do like the pose on the bird, and the out of focusness seems to work.  I think I would enjoy the graininess more if this was bw.', '2011-03-25 00:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363187, 942027, 124256, '<td valign="top">I wish the bottom left corner was cropped out.  Also, instead of just being a bunch of birds, I wish there was something to focus on, one special bird that I could identify with or something.  Your title could have helped with that.  For example, maybe you could have told us that the bird on the far right was the focus with a title like: Wait for me!</td>', 'I wish the bottom left corner was cropped out.  Also, instead of just being a bunch of birds, I wish there was something to focus on, one special bird that I could identify with or something.  Your title could have helped with that.  For example, maybe you could have told us that the bird on the far right was the focus with a title like: Wait for me!', '2011-03-25 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363192, 941004, 124256, '<td valign="top">Really cool to catch a bird so close to the moon.  Otherwise it doesn''t work for me.  The bird''s position is awkward and it''s out of focus.</td>', 'Really cool to catch a bird so close to the moon.  Otherwise it doesn''t work for me.  The bird''s position is awkward and it''s out of focus.', '2011-03-25 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363291, 941660, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very attractive urban scene. Context make the photo here.</td>', 'Very attractive urban scene. Context make the photo here.', '2011-03-25 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363292, 941565, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very nice details and contrast. B&amp;W is a good choice.</td>', 'Very nice details and contrast. B&W is a good choice.', '2011-03-25 08:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363296, 942242, 11248, '<td valign="top">Magnificent scene. From the background to the foreground.<br/>B&amp;W is a very good idea here.</td>', 'Magnificent scene. From the background to the foreground.B&W is a very good idea here.', '2011-03-25 08:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363308, 942068, 110041, '<td valign="top">great capture!</td>', 'great capture!', '2011-03-25 09:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363435, 942095, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like it.  It seems a little too dark, and I think that''s primarily because of the white lines in the border.  I bet I like it more if you just darken those lines or drop the border altogether.</td>', 'I like it.  It seems a little too dark, and I think that''s primarily because of the white lines in the border.  I bet I like it more if you just darken those lines or drop the border altogether.', '2011-03-25 13:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363436, 941769, 124256, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot all around.  I really like the framing, motion blur, and out of focus background that is obviously a wave.  I just think the hues reflecting off the water are ambiguous and distracting.  I wonder if this shot would come off better in bw.</td>', 'Awesome shot all around.  I really like the framing, motion blur, and out of focus background that is obviously a wave.  I just think the hues reflecting off the water are ambiguous and distracting.  I wonder if this shot would come off better in bw.', '2011-03-25 13:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363438, 942240, 124256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The out of focus thorn in the foreground seems out of place.  I wish there was more of it or none at all.  As it is, it''s pretty prominent and cuts through a huge part of the photo.  Worse, although it helps frame the subject, it dramatically emphasizes the leaves on the left (almost like an inset), and they don''t deserve it (not well lit, not in focus).  This would be the area to put your logo or descriptive text.  Perhaps aggressive cropping would help.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The out of focus thorn in the foreground seems out of place.  I wish there was more of it or none at all.  As it is, it''s pretty prominent and cuts through a huge part of the photo.  Worse, although it helps frame the subject, it dramatically emphasizes the leaves on the left (almost like an inset), and they don''t deserve it (not well lit, not in focus).  This would be the area to put your logo or descriptive text.  Perhaps aggressive cropping would help.', '2011-03-25 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363439, 942269, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like the angle and position of the wings.  I wish the lighting was different.  The little you can see of the right wing looks great, too bad the rest isn''t lit that well.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like the angle and position of the wings.  I wish the lighting was different.  The little you can see of the right wing looks great, too bad the rest isn''t lit that well.', '2011-03-25 14:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363441, 941083, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like this one but the title doesn''t resonate with me.  Maybe something more like Escaping through the shadows, or On the run.  Awesome shot though.</td>', 'I like this one but the title doesn''t resonate with me.  Maybe something more like Escaping through the shadows, or On the run.  Awesome shot though.', '2011-03-25 14:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363442, 942254, 124256, '<td valign="top">The stuff at the top of the image is distracting and I think really sabotages this awesome image.  I love the pose and the reflection!</td>', 'The stuff at the top of the image is distracting and I think really sabotages this awesome image.  I love the pose and the reflection!', '2011-03-25 14:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363444, 942060, 124256, '<td valign="top">Awesome with the reflection.  I don''t like the business around the feet.  Were there maybe some weeds stuck to the subject''s feet?  Also, the background above the water is distracting, taking away from the subject.  I wish it was just out of focus.  Perhaps with more context (with a wider angle shot), though, it would work better.</td>', 'Awesome with the reflection.  I don''t like the business around the feet.  Were there maybe some weeds stuck to the subject''s feet?  Also, the background above the water is distracting, taking away from the subject.  I wish it was just out of focus.  Perhaps with more context (with a wider angle shot), though, it would work better.', '2011-03-25 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363451, 942204, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, after looking at tons of these photos, this one is refreshing.  I love the light and highlights.  Both subjects are in interesting poses taken from an angle that lets us see their heads.  Either would be great alone as the subject (especially the lower one).  The sparkles dancing on the water really take me and my brain to the beach where they belong.</td>', 'Ah, after looking at tons of these photos, this one is refreshing.  I love the light and highlights.  Both subjects are in interesting poses taken from an angle that lets us see their heads.  Either would be great alone as the subject (especially the lower one).  The sparkles dancing on the water really take me and my brain to the beach where they belong.', '2011-03-25 14:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363452, 941917, 124256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and crop.  I really like this one.  Great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful color and crop.  I really like this one.  Great shot!', '2011-03-25 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363456, 942114, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I half expect there to be lines pointing out different parts of the subject''s anatomy.  It seems like the subject has some kind of glow I guess as part of the processing that I don''t like.  Great shot though!</td>', 'Nice.  I half expect there to be lines pointing out different parts of the subject''s anatomy.  It seems like the subject has some kind of glow I guess as part of the processing that I don''t like.  Great shot though!', '2011-03-25 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363457, 942248, 124256, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  I love seeing the top and bottom of the wings with them both in the down position.  Great shot.</td>', 'Really nice.  I love seeing the top and bottom of the wings with them both in the down position.  Great shot.', '2011-03-25 14:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363458, 941940, 124256, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or are the head and tail perfectly in focus but not the wings?  Anyhow, great shot, it just doesn''t pop for some reason.</td>', 'Is it just me or are the head and tail perfectly in focus but not the wings?  Anyhow, great shot, it just doesn''t pop for some reason.', '2011-03-25 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363459, 942006, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, I didn''t care for this at first glance, but now I am grooving on the silhouettes.  Beautiful and beautifully framed.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Ah, I didn''t care for this at first glance, but now I am grooving on the silhouettes.  Beautiful and beautifully framed.  Nice shot!', '2011-03-25 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363460, 942288, 124256, '<td valign="top">Wow, dramatic lighting on the subject''s face, I like it!  I think a better caption would be: Where have you been?  Great shot.</td>', 'Wow, dramatic lighting on the subject''s face, I like it!  I think a better caption would be: Where have you been?  Great shot.', '2011-03-25 14:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363461, 941129, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal effect of the vivid colors.  The out of focus/over bright face don''t work for me though.</td>', 'I like the surreal effect of the vivid colors.  The out of focus/over bright face don''t work for me though.', '2011-03-25 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363462, 941337, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I love the light.  I am less enamored by the bread, though the title helps a lot!</td>', 'Nice shot, I love the light.  I am less enamored by the bread, though the title helps a lot!', '2011-03-25 14:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363463, 942052, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I love this.  The hill and ship (or whatever that is) really help this shot a lot.  I love how the clouds echo the line of birds on the left.  Great shot!</td>', 'Ooh, I love this.  The hill and ship (or whatever that is) really help this shot a lot.  I love how the clouds echo the line of birds on the left.  Great shot!', '2011-03-25 14:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363465, 942068, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. The depth of field really helps make this photo stand out.</td>', 'Great action capture. The depth of field really helps make this photo stand out.', '2011-03-25 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363466, 942276, 124256, '<td valign="top">It seems to the the far wing is in focus but not the face.  Great action shot though.  A better caption would have helped this out a lot I bet.  I''m sure someone else could come up with better, though one idea is: Aflac, smaflac!</td>', 'It seems to the the far wing is in focus but not the face.  Great action shot though.  A better caption would have helped this out a lot I bet.  I''m sure someone else could come up with better, though one idea is: Aflac, smaflac!', '2011-03-25 14:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363468, 942004, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  It looks like the subject is smirking.  I love the sharp focus on the tail, back, and head with motion blur on the wings.  Bokeh is great in the background, though I wish the horizontal lines (especially the ones at the bottom) were level.</td>', 'Great shot.  It looks like the subject is smirking.  I love the sharp focus on the tail, back, and head with motion blur on the wings.  Bokeh is great in the background, though I wish the horizontal lines (especially the ones at the bottom) were level.', '2011-03-25 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363469, 941997, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool minimalistic approach with just a bit of context added in.</td>', 'Cool minimalistic approach with just a bit of context added in.', '2011-03-25 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363472, 941933, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. The scene in general is very cool, but the addition of the full moon really makes this a striking image.</td>', 'Well done. The scene in general is very cool, but the addition of the full moon really makes this a striking image.', '2011-03-25 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363473, 941437, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of a balanced center composition. Definitely helps you photo to stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'Interesting choice of a balanced center composition. Definitely helps you photo to stand out from the crowd.', '2011-03-25 14:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363475, 941769, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of motion blur to give this photo a sense of speed.</td>', 'Great use of motion blur to give this photo a sense of speed.', '2011-03-25 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363477, 941927, 114225, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if those are actual expressions on the face, or if I''m just introducing a human element. But either way, it''s a perfectly done capture with great intensity.</td>', 'I don''t know if those are actual expressions on the face, or if I''m just introducing a human element. But either way, it''s a perfectly done capture with great intensity.', '2011-03-25 14:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363478, 941980, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great choice to put him in the bottom of the frame. With his style of flight, that helps produce an ominous feeling.</td>', 'Great choice to put him in the bottom of the frame. With his style of flight, that helps produce an ominous feeling.', '2011-03-25 14:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363479, 941895, 128259, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-03-25 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6363480, 942121, 114225, '<td valign="top">First off, a nice capture, especially with getting some clouds in there to break up the background.<br/> <br/>However, it may just be me, but I''m seeing what looks like a high amount of chromatic aberration on the bottom of the head and the right side of the wings.</td>', 'First off, a nice capture, especially with getting some clouds in there to break up the background. However, it may just be me, but I''m seeing what looks like a high amount of chromatic aberration on the bottom of the head and the right side of the wings.', '2011-03-25 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363607, 941565, 100831, '<td valign="top">wow that''s some detail!</td>', 'wow that''s some detail!', '2011-03-25 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363608, 941395, 100831, '<td valign="top">that''s amazing. Love it.</td>', 'that''s amazing. Love it.', '2011-03-25 19:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363625, 941022, 94815, '<td valign="top">amazing detail.</td>', 'amazing detail.', '2011-03-25 20:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363626, 942018, 94815, '<td valign="top">wonderful catch!</td>', 'wonderful catch!', '2011-03-25 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363650, 941395, 70957, '<td valign="top">Seems like sharpening mask was set too high for my taste. Also, would have been nicer with some eye shine. Something about the color seems artificial -- perhaps an artifact of the sharpening used.</td>', 'Seems like sharpening mask was set too high for my taste. Also, would have been nicer with some eye shine. Something about the color seems artificial -- perhaps an artifact of the sharpening used.', '2011-03-25 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363651, 942013, 70957, '<td valign="top">I''m a bird photographer and I''m in this challenge. All I can say is WTF????!?!?!!!! I love it! I want to buy it!!! You can''t make up stuff like this.</td>', 'I''m a bird photographer and I''m in this challenge. All I can say is WTF????!?!?!!!! I love it! I want to buy it!!! You can''t make up stuff like this.', '2011-03-25 22:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363652, 942242, 70957, '<td valign="top">Wish you could have been a little closer to the action, maybe with a longer lens. Would have accentuated the foreground, middle and background feel to it.</td>', 'Wish you could have been a little closer to the action, maybe with a longer lens. Would have accentuated the foreground, middle and background feel to it.', '2011-03-25 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363653, 942310, 70957, '<td valign="top">Too much blur for my taste. I also dislike seeing the feeder in bird photos.</td>', 'Too much blur for my taste. I also dislike seeing the feeder in bird photos.', '2011-03-25 22:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363654, 941869, 70957, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow effect, but framing could have been better IMHO. I don''t care for clipped wings.</td>', 'I like the shadow effect, but framing could have been better IMHO. I don''t care for clipped wings.', '2011-03-25 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363656, 941119, 70957, '<td valign="top">Decent shot. But I''ve seen enough ducks landing in my life.</td>', 'Decent shot. But I''ve seen enough ducks landing in my life.', '2011-03-25 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363657, 941814, 129148, '<td valign="top">Brilliant title!</td>', 'Brilliant title!', '2011-03-25 22:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363658, 942248, 70957, '<td valign="top">Highlights a little blown out on top of neck. Try shooting 1 stop down next time. Eye also seems a bit soft. Otherwise, nice grab!</td>', 'Highlights a little blown out on top of neck. Try shooting 1 stop down next time. Eye also seems a bit soft. Otherwise, nice grab!', '2011-03-25 22:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363661, 942274, 130337, '<td valign="top">Wow<br/>Pat</td>', 'WowPat', '2011-03-25 22:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363678, 941220, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2011-03-25 22:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363713, 941565, 73718, '<td valign="top">Brilliant</td>', 'Brilliant', '2011-03-25 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363782, 941988, 129756, '<td valign="top">i think a tighter crop would''ve worked wonders for this one...</td>', 'i think a tighter crop would''ve worked wonders for this one...', '2011-03-26 07:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363783, 942242, 129756, '<td valign="top">wow! i almost didn''t notice the birds....perfect synergy with the landscape!</td>', 'wow! i almost didn''t notice the birds....perfect synergy with the landscape!', '2011-03-26 07:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363784, 942240, 129756, '<td valign="top">nice capture...really tough catching these w/o any motion blur...</td>', 'nice capture...really tough catching these w/o any motion blur...', '2011-03-26 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363786, 942263, 129756, '<td valign="top">lil grainy for me...</td>', 'lil grainy for me...', '2011-03-26 07:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363797, 941565, 119747, '<td valign="top">Great processing, fantastic image</td>', 'Great processing, fantastic image', '2011-03-26 08:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363932, 942067, 92577, '<td valign="top">good stuff</td>', 'good stuff', '2011-03-26 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363937, 942111, 92577, '<td valign="top">pleasing pairing</td>', 'pleasing pairing', '2011-03-26 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363943, 942121, 92577, '<td valign="top">impressive</td>', 'impressive', '2011-03-26 14:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363949, 942069, 92577, '<td valign="top">great capture - puts me in mind of an air display.</td>', 'great capture - puts me in mind of an air display.', '2011-03-26 14:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363950, 942060, 92577, '<td valign="top">v.good</td>', 'v.good', '2011-03-26 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363951, 941968, 92577, '<td valign="top">title made me lol - good luck!</td>', 'title made me lol - good luck!', '2011-03-26 14:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363958, 942013, 92577, '<td valign="top">quite remarkable - appropriate setting as well! I''m sure this will soar for you</td>', 'quite remarkable - appropriate setting as well! I''m sure this will soar for you', '2011-03-26 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363959, 941083, 92577, '<td valign="top">Great alternative shot. Arty in a ''posthumous'' style.  good luck. 8</td>', 'Great alternative shot. Arty in a ''posthumous'' style.  good luck. 8', '2011-03-26 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363962, 941927, 92577, '<td valign="top">great drama</td>', 'great drama', '2011-03-26 14:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363983, 941518, 91783, '<td valign="top">very interesting looking bird! what is it? so curious...</td>', 'very interesting looking bird! what is it? so curious...', '2011-03-26 15:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363985, 942263, 91783, '<td valign="top">if this  wasnt SO grainy, imo it would look better. maybe not so much sharpening next time?</td>', 'if this  wasnt SO grainy, imo it would look better. maybe not so much sharpening next time?', '2011-03-26 15:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363987, 941968, 91783, '<td valign="top">IF ONLY IT WAS IN FOCUS!!!!  :(</td>', 'IF ONLY IT WAS IN FOCUS!!!!  :(', '2011-03-26 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363992, 942242, 119667, '<td valign="top">amazing tones. great picture</td>', 'amazing tones. great picture', '2011-03-26 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363994, 942069, 119667, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2011-03-26 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6363998, 941988, 119667, '<td valign="top">lovely framing and focus</td>', 'lovely framing and focus', '2011-03-26 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364016, 941443, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lovely texture and feel.  The contrast is superb and the tack sharp focus on the bird''s head really sets this image off nicely.  This photo does convey a lot of motion but I think it would be even stronger in terms of this challenge if the entire bird was included in the frame.  At any rate, its a beautiful piece of work :)</td>', 'This photo has a lovely texture and feel.  The contrast is superb and the tack sharp focus on the bird''s head really sets this image off nicely.  This photo does convey a lot of motion but I think it would be even stronger in terms of this challenge if the entire bird was included in the frame.  At any rate, its a beautiful piece of work :)', '2011-03-26 17:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364024, 941443, 117717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  My favourite</td>', 'Beautiful!  My favourite', '2011-03-26 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364025, 942018, 117717, '<td valign="top">Love the detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Love the detail in the feathers.', '2011-03-26 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364026, 941565, 117717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, one of my favourites.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, one of my favourites.', '2011-03-26 17:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364089, 941913, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!!!</td>', 'Very Nice!!!', '2011-03-26 20:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364090, 941940, 117534, '<td valign="top">That is one totaly awesome view you captured there!!!</td>', 'That is one totaly awesome view you captured there!!!', '2011-03-26 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364091, 941022, 117534, '<td valign="top">love your softness</td>', 'love your softness', '2011-03-26 20:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364093, 942111, 117534, '<td valign="top">wow cool awesome beautiful stunning.. I kinda like this... LOL my first 10</td>', 'wow cool awesome beautiful stunning.. I kinda like this... LOL my first 10', '2011-03-26 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364094, 942254, 117534, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photograph, LOVE your reflection almost as sharp as the bird. My only suggestion is to have cropped the yellow dock or pier out of the picture. It stands on it''s own very well with out the background.</td>', 'This is a very good photograph, LOVE your reflection almost as sharp as the bird. My only suggestion is to have cropped the yellow dock or pier out of the picture. It stands on it''s own very well with out the background.', '2011-03-26 20:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364095, 941218, 117534, '<td valign="top">pretty pretty pretty pretty pretty</td>', 'pretty pretty pretty pretty pretty', '2011-03-26 20:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364107, 942095, 110967, '<td valign="top">I love this. I think it has a very timeless feel to it. for that reason I think the border needs to be removed.... seems too modern - 8</td>', 'I love this. I think it has a very timeless feel to it. for that reason I think the border needs to be removed.... seems too modern - 8', '2011-03-26 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364108, 942164, 110967, '<td valign="top">love it - 8</td>', 'love it - 8', '2011-03-26 21:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364132, 941814, 113419, '<td valign="top">Very different pov, wonderful shot!  love it!</td>', 'Very different pov, wonderful shot!  love it!', '2011-03-26 22:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364153, 941895, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cute, but the quality really kills this one.</td>', 'Cute, but the quality really kills this one.', '2011-03-27 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364154, 942310, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the swirling chaos that this has.</td>', 'I like the swirling chaos that this has.', '2011-03-27 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364157, 941807, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is the first halfway decent thing I''ve seen in this challenge. Your subject is beautifully framed by the natural elements. The duotone is a pleasing touch. Poetic.</td>', 'This is the first halfway decent thing I''ve seen in this challenge. Your subject is beautifully framed by the natural elements. The duotone is a pleasing touch. Poetic.', '2011-03-27 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364166, 941127, 124256, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Overall I think the shot is too dark.  I don''t know what the lighting really looked like when you took the shot, but it seems like the highlights on the subject (especially the trailing edge of the left wing) should pop much more.  As it is, the sky is by far the most vibrant part of the shot in a way that I think detracts from the subject.  Either really lightening things up or switching to bw I think would really help.</td>', 'Neat shot.  Overall I think the shot is too dark.  I don''t know what the lighting really looked like when you took the shot, but it seems like the highlights on the subject (especially the trailing edge of the left wing) should pop much more.  As it is, the sky is by far the most vibrant part of the shot in a way that I think detracts from the subject.  Either really lightening things up or switching to bw I think would really help.', '2011-03-27 00:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364167, 941938, 124256, '<td valign="top">Neat action shot with inter species interaction.  It seems like the color are just far too washed out bringing a distracting blah dimension the way I see it.  I think more saturation would really help.  Also, I''m not certain if the white bird is really in focus, but it seems like nothing else is.  I definitely wish the two birds popped in focus.</td>', 'Neat action shot with inter species interaction.  It seems like the color are just far too washed out bringing a distracting blah dimension the way I see it.  I think more saturation would really help.  Also, I''m not certain if the white bird is really in focus, but it seems like nothing else is.  I definitely wish the two birds popped in focus.', '2011-03-27 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364169, 941913, 124256, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice shot, those pelicans look great!  It seems too crowded, though.  I wish there was more space in the shot in at least one direction.  Also, somehow the lighting doesn''t pop when it seems like it should.  The shadow on the bottom left bird seems pretty advantageously sharp and dramatic, but I don''t really get the contrast I''d like to see between the direct sunlight versus in-shadow parts.</td>', 'Wow, nice shot, those pelicans look great!  It seems too crowded, though.  I wish there was more space in the shot in at least one direction.  Also, somehow the lighting doesn''t pop when it seems like it should.  The shadow on the bottom left bird seems pretty advantageously sharp and dramatic, but I don''t really get the contrast I''d like to see between the direct sunlight versus in-shadow parts.', '2011-03-27 02:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364170, 941292, 124256, '<td valign="top">It''s nice that you can see a tiny bit of the subject''s head.  I just wish I could see more of it.  Also I don''t agree with the cropping.  The foreground on the right seems well in focus and has the most dramatic highlights and shadow in the whole shot, and it''s just distracting the intended subject.</td>', 'It''s nice that you can see a tiny bit of the subject''s head.  I just wish I could see more of it.  Also I don''t agree with the cropping.  The foreground on the right seems well in focus and has the most dramatic highlights and shadow in the whole shot, and it''s just distracting the intended subject.', '2011-03-27 02:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364171, 941933, 124256, '<td valign="top">Fitting title.  I love the subtle sunset hue in the sky.  Also cool to catch the moon in there.  Unfortunately the birds in flight that are supposed to the main subject didn''t grab me.  Maybe the lazy birds on the ground (which are the ones best in focus at least because of no motion blur) provide the wrong kind of anchor.</td>', 'Fitting title.  I love the subtle sunset hue in the sky.  Also cool to catch the moon in there.  Unfortunately the birds in flight that are supposed to the main subject didn''t grab me.  Maybe the lazy birds on the ground (which are the ones best in focus at least because of no motion blur) provide the wrong kind of anchor.', '2011-03-27 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364172, 941432, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, composition, and overall framing of this shot.  I think the colors are too washed out, though.  I wish this was either bw or much more vibrant/saturated.  It also would have been nice if the post above the birds hidden head wasn''t there.  I love the shadow going across the bird''s back.</td>', 'I like the idea, composition, and overall framing of this shot.  I think the colors are too washed out, though.  I wish this was either bw or much more vibrant/saturated.  It also would have been nice if the post above the birds hidden head wasn''t there.  I love the shadow going across the bird''s back.', '2011-03-27 02:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364173, 942066, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wish this was in focus.  The colors are disappointingly washed out as well.  I think I would have enjoyed this more if it was cropped just to include the macaw on the left.</td>', 'Ah, I wish this was in focus.  The colors are disappointingly washed out as well.  I think I would have enjoyed this more if it was cropped just to include the macaw on the left.', '2011-03-27 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364175, 942284, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think this would have been a good candidate for bw.  I wish the background could be deemphasized somehow (out of focus, less contrast, motion blurred).</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think this would have been a good candidate for bw.  I wish the background could be deemphasized somehow (out of focus, less contrast, motion blurred).', '2011-03-27 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364176, 941660, 124256, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  I experimented a little and found that I much preferred the shot if cropped with the birds being towards the top or towards the bottom of the shot (instead of vertically centered).  I do think that they are fine horizontally centered as is.</td>', 'Fun shot.  I experimented a little and found that I much preferred the shot if cropped with the birds being towards the top or towards the bottom of the shot (instead of vertically centered).  I do think that they are fine horizontally centered as is.', '2011-03-27 02:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364177, 941807, 124256, '<td valign="top">I feel like I should like this much more than I do.  I guess I don''t understand the composition.  I think the plant on the right steals far too much attention.  Maybe much tighter cropping would help.  Otherwise, I love the bokeh and the bird''s posture.</td>', 'I feel like I should like this much more than I do.  I guess I don''t understand the composition.  I think the plant on the right steals far too much attention.  Maybe much tighter cropping would help.  Otherwise, I love the bokeh and the bird''s posture.', '2011-03-27 02:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364178, 942121, 124256, '<td valign="top">The subject seems really washed out.  I wish the colors were more vibrant.  Going bw might just bypass that issue and look great.  Awesome shot and framing.</td>', 'The subject seems really washed out.  I wish the colors were more vibrant.  Going bw might just bypass that issue and look great.  Awesome shot and framing.', '2011-03-27 02:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364179, 941568, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It seems out of focus or something.  I keep feeling I should like this shot much more than I do.  I wish I could put my finger on it.</td>', 'Nice shot.  It seems out of focus or something.  I keep feeling I should like this shot much more than I do.  I wish I could put my finger on it.', '2011-03-27 02:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364180, 942315, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the sharp perfect silhouette, the gorgeous cloud detail, and the well balanced framing.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the sharp perfect silhouette, the gorgeous cloud detail, and the well balanced framing.  Well done!', '2011-03-27 02:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364182, 942309, 124256, '<td valign="top">I wish the face was in focus instead of the back.  The background (color, texture, and lighting) really blends in with the subject too much.  Otherwise nice shot!</td>', 'I wish the face was in focus instead of the back.  The background (color, texture, and lighting) really blends in with the subject too much.  Otherwise nice shot!', '2011-03-27 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364183, 941988, 124256, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  The tree branches provide a great frame, the focus and contrast are striking and sharp, I love the suggestion of buildings in the bokeh, and the disinterested bird on the right adds some nice flavor.</td>', 'I really like this one.  The tree branches provide a great frame, the focus and contrast are striking and sharp, I love the suggestion of buildings in the bokeh, and the disinterested bird on the right adds some nice flavor.', '2011-03-27 02:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364185, 942174, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I wish your black bars weren''t so think.  Also, I wish there was more sky in the shot; it seems too crowded around the edges.  The perfectly centered center bird seems to distract as well.  I think I would have really like this one a lot more if you just cropped just to the left of the rightmost bird to have just one subject.</td>', 'Nice.  I wish your black bars weren''t so think.  Also, I wish there was more sky in the shot; it seems too crowded around the edges.  The perfectly centered center bird seems to distract as well.  I think I would have really like this one a lot more if you just cropped just to the left of the rightmost bird to have just one subject.', '2011-03-27 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364186, 942312, 124256, '<td valign="top">The background really makes this shot -- what was back there, was it clouds?  Beautiful silhouette.</td>', 'The background really makes this shot -- what was back there, was it clouds?  Beautiful silhouette.', '2011-03-27 02:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6364215, 942121, 105601, '<td valign="top">I must take issue with your title.<br/>This isn''t a falcon. It''s a buzzard (Europe) or hawk (US).<br/>That aside, it''s an excellent capture and a neat crop.</td>', 'I must take issue with your title.This isn''t a falcon. It''s a buzzard (Europe) or hawk (US).That aside, it''s an excellent capture and a neat crop.', '2011-03-27 08:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
