(6366735, 941869, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! I''m in my "shadow" phase, and I love the shadow. I also love how crisp the head is in this shot. I''d be tempted to crop it down just a little from the top to get rid of the tip of the right wing. It makes it look like an accident. I think if is was cropped just a tad lower, it would look more like a statement.<br/> <br/>Excellent shot! Highly enjoyable. :D (not voting, just looking :)<br/> <br/>And the winner of the tenth bluebird:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love this shot! I''m in my "shadow" phase, and I love the shadow. I also love how crisp the head is in this shot. I''d be tempted to crop it down just a little from the top to get rid of the tip of the right wing. It makes it look like an accident. I think if is was cropped just a tad lower, it would look more like a statement. Excellent shot! Highly enjoyable. :D (not voting, just looking :) And the winner of the tenth bluebird: ', '2011-03-30 00:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
