(6368587, 941119, 30861, '<td valign="top">Good to see ya back, John. I hadn''t realized you''d entered this challenge. "Jim Setzler, wildlife photographer"... Who''da thunk it? :-) This is a nice capture.<br/> <br/>I just got a used 100-400mm Canon myself. It''s hard work using those beasts! I''m just sort of starting to get the hang of it now, and now the birds are returning to the Cape, so I have my fingers crossed.</td>', 'Good to see ya back, John. I hadn''t realized you''d entered this challenge. "Jim Setzler, wildlife photographer"... Who''da thunk it? :-) This is a nice capture. I just got a used 100-400mm Canon myself. It''s hard work using those beasts! I''m just sort of starting to get the hang of it now, and now the birds are returning to the Cape, so I have my fingers crossed.', '2011-03-31 10:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
