(6372645, 942284, 117474, '<td valign="top">"I learned that birds like crossiants and I should have my shutter on 1/500"<br/>Haha. That really made me chuckle! <br/> <br/>And I like the shot. And the composure makes it seem like we''re looking to where the bird looks. It''s a nice, crisp, simple shot. Good work! :)</td>', '"I learned that birds like crossiants and I should have my shutter on 1/500"Haha. That really made me chuckle!  And I like the shot. And the composure makes it seem like we''re looking to where the bird looks. It''s a nice, crisp, simple shot. Good work! :)', '2011-04-04 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
